sou kizuita

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:26.090
そう気付いた

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:26.090
I realized that.

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:33.220
hatenaku toumei na jiyuu ni iro o tsukete ikou It's my way

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:33.220
果てなく透明な自由に色をつけていこう It's my way

00:23:26.460 --> 00:23:33.220
Let's color the endlessly transparent freedom: it's my way.

